
### Get all employees
GET http://localhost:8080/api/employees

### Get employee 1
GET http://localhost:8080/api/employees/1

### Create an employee
POST http://localhost:8080/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Amit Roy",
  "department": "Finance",
  "salary": 65000
}

### Create an employee
POST http://localhost:8080/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Priya Das",
  "department": "HR",
  "salary": 60000
}

### Create an employee

POST http://localhost:8080/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "department": "Engineering",
  "salary": -1
}

### Update employee 1
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/employees/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rahul Sharma",
  "department": "Platform Engineering",
  "salary": 85000
}

### Delete employee 2
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/employees/2

### Get by page
GET http://localhost:8080/api/employees
###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/employees?page=0&size=5
###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/employees?page=1&size=5
###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/employees?page=0&size=10&sortBy=name&direction=asc
###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/employees?page=0&size=10&sortBy=salary&direction=desc

### Search by name
GET http://localhost:8080/api/employees?search=rahul

### Filter by department
GET http://localhost:8080/api/employees?department=Engineering

### Minimum salary
GET http://localhost:8080/api/employees?minSalary=90000

### Salary range
GET http://localhost:8080/api/employees?minSalary=90000&maxSalary=130000

### Search, Filter, Pagination combined
GET http://localhost:8080/api/employees?page=0&size=5&search=rahul&department=Engineering&minSalary=80000&maxSalary=100000&sortBy=salary&direction=desc